    "body": "Superseded by `main`. Verified before archiving: every substantive artifact from this branch is present on `main` (release/decisions/*, soak + fault-injection harness, security suite, threat model, SECURITY.md, performance envelopes, immutable-release.yml, store/soak fixtures). `main` is ahead by ~5,500 lines.\n\nBranch-exclusive content was only:\n- `.agent/dispatch/completion-report.json` — preserved on main in aa54906\n- `D53` — a stray accidental copy of state.json (junk, not carried over)\n\nCommits are retained at tag `archive/dispatch-d50-d53` (-> d9ed4eb). Restore with:\n`git branch dispatch/d50-d53 archive/dispatch-d50-d53`",
